    "text": "A point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> moves in the complex plane such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
